{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_haak_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_haak_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"惊弓一夜","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_haak_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7c74d604298c4024aac3d7224b21405e9dd1dca67327e1cb8c037709f0f1aa3c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"深夜时分，有伤患寻到了阿的诊所。在为其医治的过程中，阿发现来者的身份或许很不简单。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，你怎么样了？伤口还痛吗？坚持住，我这就带你去医院。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......阿振，别，不能去医院，会、会被发现的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你个蠢蛋，我们去医院岂不是自投罗网，那些大夫都精明得很，一看到伤势就知道不对劲了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老于，这......这可怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说这巷子前面有个小诊所，去那儿碰碰运气吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小诊所的医生少，好控制，老大，要不咱们......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行......走，我、我觉得可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坚持住，老大，我们这就带你去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窗户......都锁好了，还有窗帘......一丝缝隙都不能留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"床底下的东西......我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"挺好，都在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......啊，对，还有门得反锁起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好想起来了，差点就忘......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（谁——？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是不相熟的面孔......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，请问找谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生，这里有医生吗？我大哥、我大哥受伤了，您好心救救命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诊所已经关门了，先生你明天再来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生，你、你怎么能见死不救呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真有那么严重，你们应该赶紧去正规的大医院医治，而不是半夜来敲我这间街边小诊所的门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再纠缠下去，只能说明你大哥离死还远着呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你说出这样的话还算是个医生吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，好笑，谁告诉你我是个医生了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放弃吧，这门踹不开的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*龙门粗口*......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是走了吗......？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"惴惴不安的医生屏住呼吸，伸长脖子从门镜处朝外看，看到门檐下已经没了人影。\n他不放心，又把耳朵凑近门板，过了好一会儿，确定再没有响动，才定下神来，捂着胸口长出一口气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吓死了，还以为是老东西的仇人找上门来了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到这么晚了还有人上门求诊，真是古怪......不会是前几天救过的老头又在大肆宣扬我的医术吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烦死了，早知道就放着不管了，明明当时想好了的，光治些头疼脑热的病，挣点钱够生活就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，可那老头的怪病是真教人手痒啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这地方应该不能久留了。老东西得罪了那么多人，保不准消息就传到谁耳朵里了，被人找上门来也是迟早的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行......我得换个地方过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真是晦气，好不容易过了半年安生日子......这躲躲藏藏的，什么时候才是个头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（该死......刚刚忘记把后门反锁上了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，先生，你这后门比起前门来，可是不牢靠得多啊，用铁丝捅个几下就能撬开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看来你们老大的伤还真是挺严重的啊，一刻都等不及？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，我劝你识相些，赶紧来医治我老大，他要是有个三长两短，你的小命也别想要了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小兄弟，我......你救我这次，我以后绝不、绝不亏待你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们一个唱红脸，一个唱白脸，唱得可真好听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，先生，这就是你想多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，你呢，你又是唱的什么脸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唱什么脸都行，但你可别给脸不要脸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好大的口——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶！你个混账！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你们做什么，别动我，别动我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别叫唤了，小兄弟，你还是老实些，咳咳......想想怎么治好我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小子，你下手有点轻重没？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在缝合伤口，你看不到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，老于，好了好了。先生啊，你这儿就没有什么麻醉剂吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这样的小诊所没有那种东西，嫌疼就不要上这里来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的药剂瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是不想损失更多就注意你说话的语气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（冷静，冷静，他一个胳膊有我两个腿粗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行，我和你老大说说话，分散分散他的注意力总行了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你还能答上话吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说你的，手别、别停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这背上的伤是怎么弄的？简直皮开肉绽。比画着量下来，从肩膀到后腰，快有二十厘米了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"铁栏杆上的尖刺划的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们翻墙了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......请问，我的话冒犯到诸位了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不该问的别乱问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（忍耐，忍耐，我手上没有可以对付他们的药......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你们是怎么找到这里来的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人告诉我的，这里有间小诊所，以前他来过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你们过来就仅仅是为了治伤吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就没有什么人和你们说过我的事？比如......我之前遇到的一些“病患”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看来他们只不过是三个小角色......是我反应过度了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和你聊天真费劲，算了，我把收音机打开，你对着它讲话吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（啧，既然不是来寻仇的黑帮，落在我手里，算你们倒霉。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"下面紧急播报一条新闻，今日下午六点，龙门珠宝行遭遇一起恶性抢劫事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三名持短弩的歹徒制服店员，撬开柜台，卷走价值数千万的珠宝后逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"警方表示，劫案发生后，近卫局即刻赶赴案发现场，确认一名店员与歹徒搏斗后身受重伤，目前正在抢救中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"据店员口述，三名在逃歹徒全部戴有面罩，其中一名歹徒背部受伤，应留有伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈......！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音机","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"望社会各界人士积极提供在逃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这破收音机，响个不停，真是烦死人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"还没等播报声结束，坐在桌旁的男人便粗鲁地按下了关机键。\n医生僵硬地侧过头，看见男人面色不悦，手插进兜里，似乎是在摩挲着什么。\n再低下头，看着床上那人鲜血淋漓的后背，医生倒吸一口凉气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不妙啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吞咽口水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......还能有什么，他的伤口啊，我这边没有足够的药物，只能做些缝合的工作，不能保证后面的恢复情况。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，先生，你站起来干什么去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想去打个电话让人送药来，你紧张什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打电话？这可不行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看他们这副警觉的样子，八九不离十了。怎么办......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搞不好......他们会为了防止踪迹泄露让我永远闭嘴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（或者......不、不行，不能暴露自己的身份，好不容易才摆脱老东西的影响安定下来。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（把一只手揣进兜里摩挲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（糟了，他又把手放进口袋了，里面是刀子吗？还是短弩？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（冷静，得想个办法......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不、不行，这样做的话......身份不就暴露了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你小子在那里一言不发的想干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我在想怎么才能拿到你们老大需要的药，你们又不让我打电话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们老大躺在那里，正是需要药的时候，总不能让他等死吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（唉......顾不上之后的事了，先保性命。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这样如何？你们一个人去买药，另外一个人留在这里，放心，就我这个身板，能对你们老大做什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......老于你说呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿振，你去买药，我来看着这小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可要是他使坏的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，就算只有我一个人在，这小子也翻不出什么风浪来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*龙门粗口*，这药店位置也太偏僻了，真是让我好找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板、老板在吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"药店老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来了、来了，您等下，这就来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这里有一份药方，你看看，上面的药材都有吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"药店老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有是有，可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是什么？有还不赶紧拿来，我老大急着用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"药店老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你老大......要用？敢问这位朋友，你的老大是什么来头啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，奉劝你一句，做生意好奇心不要太重，我老大的事情不是你这种人可以打听的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"药店老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是是是......您说的是，稍等，我这就让店员拿给您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻利点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"药店老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小安，过来，按着这个单子去拿药，记住不要拿错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"药店老板","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（顺便打电话给那位先生，就说......就说那人没死，回来了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位先生，能不能别来回走了，看得我头晕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那家伙要是回不来，有你好受的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我给他指的药店非常隐蔽，绝不会轻易被人发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算算时间，差不多就该......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，这不回来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿振，东西带回来了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，老大怎么样了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没死，就等着你送药来呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......给，你需要的药材。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错，都是上好的药材。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老于，我们得带上老大快些离开了，我回来的路上，老远就听到了近卫局的警笛声，估计是已经搜查到这附近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一会儿，咱们拿了药就走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你小子干什么呢？这么大动静。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消创药，让你们老大一天吃三次，加上这剂补药，晚上睡前吃一次，不到半个月伤口就能完全恢复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，这是我半年来攒下的积蓄，你们拿去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小兄弟，你这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"花钱买平安，你们对自己的来历守口如瓶，肯定是不希望别人打探到自己的去向。我也只能识趣些，恭送诸位离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只求留我一条小命，要是将来有缘再见，你们再有个头疼脑热的，我也派得上用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（再次把手放进兜里摩挲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他还不满意吗？都退让到这个地步了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，为了保证三位能够安全离开这里，我来引开近卫局的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们老大套上我的衣服，我穿上你们老大的血衣，两人互换装扮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后我从前门出去，吸引近卫局的注意，这时候，你们就从后门悄悄离开，如何？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（这小子怎么突然变得这么懂事，之前不是还硬气得不得了吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（挨了你那么几拳，谁能不老实啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（说得对，既然这小子现在这么识时务，以后咱们要是手头紧了，就上这儿来搞点钱花。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘿......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，想不到......小兄弟你是这么讲义气的人。这份情，我们领了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿振，老于，还不谢过这位先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，想不到那小子没骗我们，真把近卫局的条子引走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我们到哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，过了前面这个巷子，就是鼠王的地盘。我们藏在那里，近卫局的肯定不敢找过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钱都藏好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，全部埋在院子里的松树下了，等到事情平息了，我们就挖出来，足足......算不清，反正这辈子都不用愁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到时候拿到钱，老大你伤也好了，我们就去市中心的游戏厅玩个三天三夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等......等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们是谁？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拦住他们三个，别让他们跑了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，那个人，把手从兜里拿出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们要干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你兜里是什么，掏出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我兜里是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你一直揣着干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不快说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我兜里有根线头，我就是想把它扽出来......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看几位兄弟，是黑帮的打扮，不知道我们是做了什么事，招惹到你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你让他去沈老板那里买的药？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，是我受伤了，急需用药，才让小弟去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好家伙，原来你就是毒医，藏了大半年，可终于让我们给找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别动我老大！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不老实......给我狠狠地打。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别打了，别打了！这位先生，老于平常就护着老大，老大伤着呢，他这人又性子急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_600_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说的毒医，我们真的不认识，说不定是有什么误会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，这些话你留着和我们老大说吧，看看他会不会仔仔细细地听上一听，都带走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的男人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大，老大！你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你们要带我们去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑帮打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_305_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那家伙也拽起来带走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强壮的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_601_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放开我，我能自己走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，都是误会一场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，当时你穿着一身血衣出现在路边，执勤的警官看见能不紧张吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能理解，我都能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，就送你到这里了，小伙子，快回家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，恐怕我现在是回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你别担心，那几个抢劫犯已经被我们抓获了，正在羁押中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到这么快，我不是才刚刚提供完线索吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"劫案发生不久后，我们就在一家地下当铺寻找到了他们的踪迹，很快就查到了他们的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当铺......他们在当铺的话，那昨天出现在我家里的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜应该是几个小毛贼吧，最近常有人报警说家中失窃，好像还在其中一家的栏杆上留下了血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......他们居然没骗我，还真是翻墙受的伤。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"以为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没，没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"小伙子，这什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官......我有一个小小的尝试，最终还是失败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这话说的，年轻人未来还有大把的时间可以挥霍，多几次失败的尝试也不打紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"不多试几次，怎么知道自己真正想要的是什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毒医","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和我实在太像了，啧，是好事，也是坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老东西，没事做就多吃几服药治治脑子，你最近又惹上什么人了？害得我平白无故被人追了两条街。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毒医","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎——你最后不是凭借我教给你的一身好本领顺利脱身了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，我还应该谢谢你？有你这老东西当我爸，真是我几辈子修来的福气啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毒医","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不谢，不谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话说，你真就不能安分几天，让我好好过两天清闲日子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毒医","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......放弃吧，你过不了那样的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是，就算你死了，我也会天天被你的仇家在屁股后面追，肯定清静不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毒医","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好儿子，就算没有仇家追，你也一样过不了那样的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"毒医","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我都说了，你和我太像，我骨子里的不安分，你一样也有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你放屁，我和你才不像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_building_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你怎么突然这么盯着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太可惜，我能尝试的道路少得可怜，一条行不通，就只能回到另一条。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不是什么坦途啊。不过......似乎也没有那么糟，至少能有点乐子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的日子实在是太平淡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_225_haak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警官，不打扰了，你人不错，希望我们以后没什么再见的机会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你这小子神神叨叨的，嘴里尽说些怪话，真是让人一头雾水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，事情那么多，还是赶紧回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"张警官留步啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，鲤先生，你来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许久不见，听说你喜得贵女啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，鲤先生，还是你消息灵通，六斤多的胖姑娘，我太太可费了好大的力气啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟，这不得赶紧去金店打上两只金镯子好好慰问慰问尊夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"早想到了，就在口袋里揣着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你啊，估计以后喝酒是叫不出来咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，鲤先生你叫我，哪有不去的道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这滑头，说得真好听，我可得好好去你长官那里说道说道去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可白跑一趟了，他老人家正在里面开大会，到现在还没出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近有什么大案子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道什么呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......应该告诉鲤先生你也无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"据说，那个之前闹得满城风雨的毒医，好像又回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前不是说他死了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，但是今天有线报过来，说是有人找到他曾经常去的药房，抓了几样药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"就这几味药，单个抓不稀奇，和别的一起抓不稀奇，可合起来一起抓的......就只有那个人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哎呀，看来又要闹得一阵不安宁啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局警官"]}]}
